  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Authoring",
      "items": [
        "da-live is the browser-based authoring UI (browse, canvas editor, sheet, media)",
        "da-nx (\"Nexter\") supplies the shared shell and blocks: chat-ao (AI chat), editortoggle (edit \u2192 canvas rollout), nav/sidenav",
        "da-admin is the single source of truth for content CRUD, auth and config"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Collaboration",
      "items": [
        "da-collab runs a Durable Object per document for real-time Y.js sync",
        "da-admin and da-collab hold mutual service bindings to coordinate reads and persisted writes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "AI coworker (Adobe CX)",
      "items": [
        "The chat-ao block connects over WebSocket to Adobe's Agent Orchestrator (\"Coworker\"), an external Experience Cloud agent \u2014 not hosted in this workspace",
        "Coworker (and any other MCP client such as Claude or Cursor) calls DA back through da-mcp's 17 tools for repo/content/preview/publish operations",
        "da-agent and da-sc are legacy/side projects being phased out in favor of this Coworker + da-mcp path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Publishing",
      "items": [
        "da-content is the public edge origin for published sites, reading storage directly and falling back to da-admin",
        "da-mcp's preview/publish tools call the Helix/HLX6 admin APIs that front Edge Delivery",
        "Published output is consumed by Edge Delivery Services (aem.live / aem.page)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}